---
import { withBase } from '@/engine/routing/paths';
import BaseLayout from '@/engine/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description = 'Learn how GameInsider handles information, cookies and third-party services.';
const updated = 'October 17, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title={`${title} | GameInsider`} description={description} path="/privacy/">
  <div class="container section legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>GameInsider is a gaming information website. This policy explains what information may be handled when you browse our pages or contact us.</p>

    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>You can read the site without creating an account. If you contact us, we may receive the name, email address and message you choose to submit. We use that information to respond to your enquiry and address reported errors.</p>

    <h2>Technical information</h2>
    <p>Our hosting provider may process technical information needed to deliver and protect the website, such as IP addresses, request details, browser information and server logs. The information available depends on the services in use and their configuration.</p>

    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>If analytics tools are enabled, they may use cookies or similar technologies to measure visits and understand how readers use the site. If advertising is enabled, GameInsider and its advertising partners may process information about browser activity, cookies and ad interactions to deliver, measure and, where permitted, personalise advertising.</p>
    <p>Third-party services operate under their own privacy policies. Their data practices depend on the services enabled, your settings and applicable law. We do not claim that every third-party service uses the same data practices.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and choices</h2>
    <p>Cookies and similar technologies may be used for essential site functions, analytics or advertising where those services are active. You can manage cookies through your browser settings. Where required, additional consent choices will be provided. See our <a href={withBase('/cookie-policy/')}>Cookie Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To operate, maintain and protect the website.</li>
      <li>To respond to messages and investigate reported errors.</li>
      <li>To understand site usage when analytics is enabled.</li>
      <li>To deliver and measure advertising when advertising services are enabled.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>External websites</h2>
    <p>Our guides may link to game publishers, app stores and other third-party websites. Once you leave GameInsider, the destination site's privacy policy and terms apply.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>GameInsider is intended for a general audience and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly seek personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has submitted personal information to us, contact us so we can review the matter.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy when our website, services or legal obligations change. The date at the top indicates the latest revision.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions or requests concerning information you have submitted, please use our <a href={withBase('/contact/')}>contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>